      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "い、いますよ。\n普段はユーシィさんとかが、やってくれていて……。\nただ、最近はちょっと忙しくしてたかもしれません",
      "jp_sha256": "f6de8e94f6d8ffbe9bcef5231c38027fd44d4747deee247505c1bbb0ad6681b1",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "이, 있어요.\n평소에는 유시 씨 같은 분이 해 주시는데…….\n다만 최근에는 조금 바빴을지도 몰라요",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 28,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "8c274f8598d5562e4864dd876809881964e9a98dde584288bce5952cf3a39553:000002_107813419834015087:g0:r27",
      "row_index_0based": 27,
      "serialized_row_index": 27,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "い、いますよ。\n普段はユーシィさんとかが、やってくれていて……。\nただ、最近はちょっと忙しくしてたかもしれません"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "8ac00518b097f177bb061befcfa5f0986ff4fc6d0603d92ea76b0594c2414623",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ユーシィ……ああ、クーシー娘の。\nあの子はいいわね。かなり有能で。\n持ち帰って新星寮の管理を任せたいくらい。",
      "jp_sha256": "a3b1382bc2dd80362cd2a5214d98c95f317f2296654868f5e5699d7a5a928aca",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "유시…… 아아, 쿠시 소녀.\n그 아이는 괜찮지. 상당히 유능하고.\n데려가서 신세이료 관리를 맡기고 싶을 정도야.",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 42,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "8c274f8598d5562e4864dd876809881964e9a98dde584288bce5952cf3a39553:000002_107813419834015087:g0:r41",
      "row_index_0based": 41,
      "serialized_row_index": 41,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "マハムート",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
